## Response Format

```
{
  "journeys": [
    {
      "duration": number,  // in seconds
      "sections": [
        {
          "duration": number,
          "departure_date_time": string,
          "arrival_date_time": string,
          "from": {
            "name": string,
            "coordinates": {
              "lon": number,
              "lat": number
            }
          },
          "to": {
            "name": string,
            "coordinates": {
              "lon": number,
              "lat": number
            }
          },
          "type": "walking" | "public_transport" | "transfer",
          "geojson": {
            "type": "LineString",
            "coordinates": [[number, number]],
            "properties": [{ "length": number }]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## Error Responses

* 400: Missing parameters or invalid coordinate format

* 500: Internal server error (RATP API error)